      "cooked": "<p>Should Becon's innate ability be unlimited? It does not list the unlimited trait, but it's almost identical to other hersos innate abilities that do show the trait (ex. ra)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>i ask ask bc we were playing a game where baron blade stripped the power cards from the heroes. Ra could still shoot twice but Becon could not, the Becon player found it extreamly infair.&nbsp;</p>",
